; pricing_addendum.pdf: Tier 2; pricing_addendum.pdf: Enterprise Legacy Discount\r\n6   acct_003       2026-01         76000          100000               0            0            0                   0.0             False                                                                                                                pricing_addendum.pdf: Usage Pricing Tiers\r\n7   acct_003       2026-02        132000          100000           32000        32000            0                  64.0             False                                                                                                                             pricing_addendum.pdf: Tier 1\r\n8   acct_003       2026-03        220000          100000          120000       100000        20000                 230.0             False                                                                                               pricing_addendum.pdf: Tier 1; pricing_addendum.pdf: Tier 2\r\n"]
